title: TopicHub
---
<<SetShot "TwoShot">>

<<declare $topic1 = "...">>
<<declare $topic2 = "...">>
<<declare $topic3 = "...">>

<<ShufflePlayerToCharacterTopics {GetCurrentActor()}>>

<<set $topic1 = GetPlayerToCharacterTopic(GetCurrentActor(), 0)>>
<<set $topic2 = GetPlayerToCharacterTopic(GetCurrentActor(), 1)>>
<<set $topic3 = GetPlayerToCharacterTopic(GetCurrentActor(), 2)>>

-> Talk about {$topic1} <<if $topic1 != "..." >>
    <<detour {$topic1}>>
-> Talk about {$topic2} <<if $topic2 != "...">>
    <<detour {$topic2}>>
-> Talk about {$topic3} <<if $topic3 != "...">>
    <<detour {$topic3}>>
-> Reshuffle topics <<if GetPlayerToCharacterTopicAmount(GetCurrentActor()) > 3>>
    Prince: Let me think again
    <<jump TopicHub>>
-> Give word to {GetCurrentActor()} <<if GetCharacterToPlayerTopicAmount(GetCurrentActor()) > 0>>
    Prince: You got something to say?
    <<jump TopicHubNPC>>
-> Finish conversation
    Prince: I think that's all for now.
    <<stop>>

<<jump TopicHubNPC>>
===